the Cloud Pub/Sub quite yet.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.640
So we can--

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.140
OK.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:56.800
It's growing.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.300
It's 25 now.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.370
So it's picking up.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:03.460
But basically, the thing is that
what is happening right now,

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:07.090
horizontal pod autoscaling is
getting new updates from Cloud

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:10.270
Pub/Sub, with the magic
being number of messages

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.710
in the queue.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:15.970
So in the meantime, I hope
that our deployment has already

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:20.360
been autoscaled.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.960
So all right, still
we have only two.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.820
So let's take a look
at horizontal pod

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.250
autoscaler again--

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:31.240
still 25, slow
delivery of metrics.

