00:30:53.075 --> 00:30:54.065
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE],

00:30:54.065 --> 00:30:55.900
IGNACY KOWALCZYK: [SIGHS] Again.

00:31:03.660 --> 00:31:05.570
All right, and
it's being created.

00:31:05.570 --> 00:31:08.310
Now let me switch
to presentation

00:31:08.310 --> 00:31:12.030
to show you in bigger
